      "english": "I thought about it and said, “Chacha, when I can’t be together with Daxing, I am also unhappy."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "但是因为这样，和大星在一起的时候，我更高兴。",
      "traditional": "但是因為這樣，和大星在一起的時候，我更高興。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì yīn wèi zhè yàng hé dà xīng zài yì qǐ de shí hou wǒ gèng gāo xìng",
      "english": "But because of this, when I am with Daxing, I am even happier."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "茶茶，你想想，什么是真的‘高兴’？做了这个世界的主人，你真的会高兴吗？”",
      "traditional": "茶茶，你想想，什麼是真的‘高興’？做了這個世界的主人，你真的會高興嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "chá chá nǐ xiǎng xiǎng shén me shì zhēn de gāo xìng zuò le zhè ge shì jiè de zhǔ rén nǐ zhēn de huì gāo xìng ma",
      "english": "Chacha, think about it, what is true ‘happiness’? If you become the master of this world, will you really be happy?”"
    },
    {
