    "sentence_translations": [
      "(22) It Will Get Better",
      "",
      "I thought about it and said, “Chacha, when I can’t be together with Daxing, I am also unhappy.",
      "But because of this, when I am with Daxing, I am even happier.",
      "Chacha, think about it, what is true ‘happiness’? If you become the master of this world, will you really be happy?”",
      "",
      "I saw that Chacha stopped. Apple’s body no longer had ’paradise’. The TV and computer also no longer had ‘paradise’.",
      "",
      "I was too exhausted. I was shutting down.",
      "I couldn’t see Daxing’s dad and mom. I also couldn’t see Daxing …",
      "I heard Daxing call me. I knew he would take me to that small store, and I knew my body would get better.",
      "I will be with Daxing together, together ...",
      "",
      "“Xiaomi!”",
      "",
      "“I am here …”"
    ]
  }
